(6361555, 941925, 121789, '<td valign="top">Keep your eye on the front post for best quick accuracy! The sight picture seems just a little fuzzy - if it were sharper, I''d be able to score higher. Great concept - 5</td>', 'Keep your eye on the front post for best quick accuracy! The sight picture seems just a little fuzzy - if it were sharper, I''d be able to score higher. Great concept - 5', '2011-03-23 17:32:25.000000', NULL, 1),
