(6364648, 941990, 115145, '<td valign="top">Next time you need to set your white balance. The vine should be more of a light grayish white, not blue.</td>', 'Next time you need to set your white balance. The vine should be more of a light grayish white, not blue.', '2011-03-27 22:06:55.000000', NULL, 1),
