(6366450, 941257, 108069, '<td valign="top">This is an incredible photo. Of course your eyes are pulled in two directions, or three, for nerds like me that like lines fading away in the distance. But really, her veil tells you you shouldn''t be looking there, and her stockings tell you you should be looking there. At the end we''re just here with a technically perfect photo. Nice balance.</td>', 'This is an incredible photo. Of course your eyes are pulled in two directions, or three, for nerds like me that like lines fading away in the distance. But really, her veil tells you you shouldn''t be looking there, and her stockings tell you you should be looking there. At the end we''re just here with a technically perfect photo. Nice balance.', '2011-03-29 20:58:36.000000', NULL, 1),
