(6366672, 942184, 129586, '<td valign="top">Very interesting.  Too bad your feline friend doesn''t have some more pronounced markings on the face.  It took me a couple of minutes to pick up on the reflection in the water drop.  Once I figured that out I loved it.  Is there any way you could make that bigger and the blurred eye a little smaller?  Really cool.</td>', 'Very interesting.  Too bad your feline friend doesn''t have some more pronounced markings on the face.  It took me a couple of minutes to pick up on the reflection in the water drop.  Once I figured that out I loved it.  Is there any way you could make that bigger and the blurred eye a little smaller?  Really cool.', '2011-03-30 00:12:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6366673, 942125, 129586, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  Would have been even better if you''d gotten a little lower so we could see the sky through the lower part of the bench.  Great clouds and light shining through.</td>', 'Nicely done.  Would have been even better if you''d gotten a little lower so we could see the sky through the lower part of the bench.  Great clouds and light shining through.', '2011-03-30 00:14:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6366676, 942180, 129586, '<td valign="top">The only thing that draws me in is the fact that the two is the only ball in focus.  I''m not sure that makes it a focal point.</td>', 'The only thing that draws me in is the fact that the two is the only ball in focus.  I''m not sure that makes it a focal point.', '2011-03-30 00:18:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6366680, 942318, 129586, '<td valign="top">Turn the chairs to face the focal point.  They''d help add to the depth of the picture.</td>', 'Turn the chairs to face the focal point.  They''d help add to the depth of the picture.', '2011-03-30 00:20:29.000000', NULL, 1),
