(6367021, 941937, 51638, '<td valign="top">Cool shot Robert. A similar phenomenon occurs in Broome in the north of Western Australia, which is referred to at the <a href="//broomevisitorcentre.com.au/events_monthly.asp" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Staircase to the Moon</a> and is a major attraction. I assume your shot is taken over mudflats, giving the same effect?</td>', 'Cool shot Robert. A similar phenomenon occurs in Broome in the north of Western Australia, which is referred to at the Staircase to the Moon and is a major attraction. I assume your shot is taken over mudflats, giving the same effect?', '2011-03-30 02:32:07.000000', NULL, 0),
