(6367295, 941932, 113278, '<td valign="top">32nd really??/ You got robbed. This met the challenge well and was well done. I gave you a 9. Should of been top 10 at least.</td>', '32nd really??/ You got robbed. This met the challenge well and was well done. I gave you a 9. Should of been top 10 at least.', '2011-03-30 08:01:35.000000', NULL, 0),
