(6369849, 942244, 13958, '<td valign="top">Well done and congratulation for your ribbon. A stunning photo and the mood is captured perfectly. And yet I have a huge but .. my eye does not rest on this photo anywhere. (as requested in the description) It keeps going from the umbrella to the mountains to the clouds to the lines on the ground. Maybe I am too critical, definitively not jealous. Please forgive me Jennifer, thats how I see it.</td>', 'Well done and congratulation for your ribbon. A stunning photo and the mood is captured perfectly. And yet I have a huge but .. my eye does not rest on this photo anywhere. (as requested in the description) It keeps going from the umbrella to the mountains to the clouds to the lines on the ground. Maybe I am too critical, definitively not jealous. Please forgive me Jennifer, thats how I see it.', '2011-04-01 12:00:03.000000', NULL, 0),
